{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">《2026 香港小姐競選決賽》今晚（30 日）8 時於 TVB 翡翠台現場直播，今屆司儀陣容由馬國明、蕭正楠、曹永廉、陸浩明及鄭衍峰聯手擔綱。</span><br/><br/></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a88bf3a4-d3b8-4f2e-b28b-c1d893d8bed4.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026vk3eZgobRU1788089376.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a88bf3a4-d3b8-4f2e-b28b-c1d893d8bed4.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">在率先登場的紅地氈環節中，日前宣布求婚成功的陸浩明甫出場即十分 Sharp 醒，果然人逢喜事精神爽。 而入行 26 年首度解鎖港姐司儀任務的馬國明，出場時亦毫無緊張之色，更與老友蕭正楠、曹永廉齊齊大擺型仔 Pose，展現超強默契與自信，為今晚決賽揭開精彩序幕。</span><br/><br/></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"db1b62f0-6b92-45cb-8d2b-f752f241c1a7.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026IKKywPeKd01788089375.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"db1b62f0-6b92-45cb-8d2b-f752f241c1a7.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a17bf1b4-036d-4622-8972-879cf4707757.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026sz6ZKEH1D01788089377.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a17bf1b4-036d-4622-8972-879cf4707757.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-30T11:58:07.453963+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":202,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}